# The program of ../../answers is one in which tests of positions are placed in front of element reads, stretches behind them are copied with ways back, a loop is separated from its unlikely paths, and the copies for other storage ask each element whether it is there.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: compile
# STATISTIC: TypeTestsPlaced >= 1
# STATISTIC: StretchCopiesToWaysBack >= 1
# STATISTIC: LoopsSeparatedFromUnlikelyPaths >= 1
# STATISTIC: ElementPresenceTestsPlaced >= 1
# CHECK: image not empty
# PROGRAM-OF: ../../answers/non-number-elements-tested-compared-read.ir
